WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.030
<b>Summary of previous episodes</b>

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:05.250
<b>Genius</b>

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:06.480
<i>Last week on </i>Frankenstein Family<i>...</i>

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:12.990
<i>The landlord who owns our house 
is coming back for the first time.</i>

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.910
<i>We can't have him seeing 
how abnormal our family is.</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:25.010
<i>But we only have a few of the pills
 that makes them look human left,</i>

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:30.560
<i>so we formed a plan and moved to infiltrate 
the institute where we used to live.</i>

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.620
<i>The place was pretty 
strictly guarded, though.</i>

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:43.230
<i>I'd like to get the medicine 
out without being seen, but...</i>

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.210
<i>Let's go back to the lab!</i>

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.750
<i>There must be more medicine there,</i>

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:50.150
<i>and the research data, too!</i>

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:23.210
<b>Frankenstein Family</b>

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:42.450
<b>#5: Infiltration</b>

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.760
Wanna get pasta today?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.010
Nah, not in the mood.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.620
There are six researchers.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:04.060
The police officer at the 
entrance is no problem.

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.790
The lab where the data's kept
 will be the tricky part.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.790
We need to get the staff 
out of there somehow.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.840
I'm going to need you guys' help.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.940
Yeah, about that...

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:30.810
There!

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.900
You want me to go?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.340
Uh-oh!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.020
My bad.

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:17.710
Here.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.070
This is it!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.780
Come on, let's go.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.660
It's gonna rain?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:40.670
I wonder if it's even possible
 to get back home like this...

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:49.140
My dog form can't handle lightning...

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.640
Clothes! Clothes!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.200
Guess you won't be turning into 
a dog until the lightning stops.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.650
We can just walk, then. Let's go.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.880
Tani-chan, may I?

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:01.650
Need a potty break!

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.650
I need to go to the bathroom!

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.650
Hold it until we're out of here!

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.660
Are you telling me to pee outside?!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.660
Don't you always?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:12.160
Do you not get that I'm a woman?!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.660
Fine...

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:22.410
I can't believe those famous researchers 
were living in a place like this.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:26.260
You remember what their thesis was about?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.440
I'm not sure I'd call that research...

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.700
Yeah, it was more like fantasy.

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:35.410
But why would people that talented 
be doing research like that?

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.640
I'm pretty sure my professor said...

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.430
Did this blow in from outside?

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:42.850
You think?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.910
Were there women in this area?

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.570
You think it's a ghost?

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.660
Try to act a little like a scientist, okay?

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.160
Hide! Hide!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.620
Get in here!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.670
Paranormal studies is a legitimate science.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:03.170
Fine, fine. We'll check it out, then.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:10.640
We'll just have to go on the offensive!

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.640
Hey, is someone in there?

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.440
Well, want to grab something to eat?

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.020
Yesterday I was watching TV and I saw...

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.450
<i>I finally get to meet those kids!</i>

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.250
A-Are you...

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.980
<i>Is this girl one of the children?</i>

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:45.910
Yes, I am.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.930
Are you the landlord I've heard about?

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.460
Are you Suishi-chan?

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:56.930
Yes.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.940
I saw you in the documents.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:03.700
Why are you sitting on the stairs, though?

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.830
<i>Wait... did she come out to meet me?</i>

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:09.950
I don't have a key.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.450
Everyone went out. I'm watching the house.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.380
<i>Where did the others go?</i>

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.270
<i>Are they not coming back?</i>

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:23.170
<i>They're not shunning her, are they?</i>

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.710
<i>So annoying.</i>

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.710
Anyway, let's go inside.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:30.880
Here.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:37.950
Welcome to my house... or so I'd like to say,

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:41.630
but it looks like you've already 
gotten pretty settled in.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.690
<i>Hang in there, man! Don't lose it!</i>

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.980
Just think of a topic...

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:01.790
I suppose I should introduce myself.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.990
My name is Yu Kaito.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.090
C-Call me Kuma-san!

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.670
My profession is...

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:09.670
Drink.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.140
Okay, maybe I will!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.140
It might calm you down.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:18.480
Erk!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.390
Oh, boy...

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.650
<i>I wonder when the others are coming back.</i>

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.650
<i>I'm so bad at one-on-one...</i>

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.950
I'm going to wash up.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:36.590
<i>Come back soon, Tanisu.</i>

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.640
Something fell!

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.200
The light's on inside the room.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.140
Is Suishi warning us?

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.810
Could that be the others coming back?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.110
Guys, take your medicine!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:09.650
No way!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.150
Just bear it for now!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.160
What's going on here?!

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.760
Are you our landlord?

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.510
Y-Yes.

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:26.770
Well, first... Would you all like to wash up?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.140
Looks delicious!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.280
Let's eat!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.890
Isn't it good?

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.070
That one's mine!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:03.290
What is this called? I love it!

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:06.290
It's called pizza! You've never had it?

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.500
Pizza is delicious!

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:13.420
<i>I'm so glad they're all in good spirits.</i>

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:17.970
Now that you're all here, I should 
probably introduce myself again.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:26.020
My name is Yu Kaito. Call me Kuma-san!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.900
I've been so busy, I haven't been 
able to take proper care of you...

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.800
It's awful!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:44.410
We're living in this unfamiliar place, 
and you never explained anything to us!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.410
I see... I'm sorry!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:50.740
I spent every day stressing out 
over what might happen to us!

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:55.810
You're being a bit rude.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:59.800
Who cares?! He's a good person.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.800
Did you forget what
 happened with the tutor?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.030
He's got "nice guy" written 
all over his face!

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:09.810
Compared to her, the landlord 
is really nice person!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.520
Sumire-chan, too!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.820
<i>What happened after that?</i>

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.540
Is anyone here?

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.290
No choice... We'll just have to do it!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.670
A dog?

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.180
A stray?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.980
Heck, we should've just started with this!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.640
I was hoping to keep things 
as quiet as possible.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.830
Let's hurry, before they wake up.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:12:00.900
I'll find the pup. You guys head for the lab.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.570
We'll meet up on the beach in 30 minutes!

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:08.120
Let's scare them!

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.410
Doesn't that hurt?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:16.420
I'll be fine, but don't try this at home.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:43.580
Is this where you've been hiding?

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.420
Sorry for forcing you before...

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.120
Well, let's get going.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.440
C'mon!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:12.610
Let's go.

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:30.330
No one's here. C'mon, quick!

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:49.300
Nothing beats your own bed!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.380
What is it?

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:11.320
Hey, that's...

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:17.790
I wonder if we'll ever get to live here again.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.050
Okay, so this means...

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.830
What color do you think?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.830
Let's make a house for everyone!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.300
Wow!

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.570
Let's go.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.820
We need to go.

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:36.820
Please.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.050
Once again, welcome, everyone!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:06.120
Starting today, this will be your new home!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.230
That dog was...

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:36.430
Wait. First, look at this.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:38.850
<b>No boys allowed♥</b>

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.850
<b>No boys allowed♥</b>

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.270
I knew it...

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:46.860
<b>No boys allowed♥</b>

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.860
Paranormal studies are an 
important scientific field.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.980
You're kidding me!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:27.960
<b>Frankenstein Extras!</b>

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.660
<i>Frankenstein Extras!</i>

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.960
<b>Today's theme is...</b>

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.960
<i>Today's theme is...</i>

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.350
Everyone, hello.

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:32.250
I am the protagonist!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.740
I play the protagonist...

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:35.580
Ashisu!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.680
It's kind of disheartening 
to do this by myself.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:41.930
That's a joke, actually.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.520
I'm Hayami Saori and I play 
the oldest daughter, Ashisu.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:47.020
<b>Ashisu  16 years old, eldest daughter.
She has plant DNA, so she can grow 
plants from her body at will.</b>

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:47.020
Ashisu
 Hayami Saori

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.020
Nice to meet you.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:53.730
I have these flipboards, and I heard that
 everyone answered the question on it.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:59.820
"If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?"

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:07.030
Hmm... I wouldn't want any 
modifications that would hurt.

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:14.120
So, like... doing this, and water comes out.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:16.130
Like... fwoosh.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:21.150
People in the studio run 
out of drinks and such.

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:24.530
So if someone ran out of water, I'd say...

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.280
"Here!"

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:28.100
and refresh them.

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:36.980
It's a bit cliche, but I'd love 
a body that doesn't get tired.

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:42.750
I can stay up as long as I want, and 
I'm not adversely affected at all.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:47.810
I could have fun late into the night.

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:50.130
I mean... I could work late into the night!

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:52.770
And a third?

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:54.630
A third?

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:58.170
The ability to know tomorrow's weather.

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:05.310
If I knew tomorrow's weather, 
I'd know if I had to wear tall boots.

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:08.530
Of course, I can just look 
at the weather forecast!

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:09.890
What, then...

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.040
I know!

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:17.060
The ability to create other modified humans!

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.600
It's a bit like using magic.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:26.770
The power to give out powers to other people.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:30.010
First, the ability to create water.

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:36.510
Water comes out of my body, but I 
never get tired, no matter what I do.

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:46.240
And as a result of not getting tired, I can 
give modifications to the people around me.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:51.350
I would make more modified 
humans all around the world.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:59.000
The other voice actors are 
doing it, so they asked me.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:21:01.280
<b>Snow  17 years old, the oldest of the five siblings
He was fused with a white dog and can
 maintain human, canine, and half-dog forms.</b>

00:20:53.450 --> 00:21:01.280
Snow
 Namikawa Daisuke

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:04.070
So then they locked me in this room.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:07.120
Is that it? Okay.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:09.120
Ta-da.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:16.310
"If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?"

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.200
<b>If you were going to be modified,
 what power would you want?</b>

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:20.210
Well, that's the kind of 
thing you ask little kids...

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:24.020
Let's see. I've had a lot of dreams.

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:28.790
For instance, I want to be 
a car. I want to be a plane.

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:32.270
I think all little boys think that 
at some point in their lives.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:35.820
We want to be able to 
transform into other things.

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:40.840
To be able to press a button 
and my voice comes out.

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:43.970
I want to be modified to do that.

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:47.070
I say that to my manager a lot.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:53.080
"I can't just press a button 
and have my voice come out!"

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:56.750
"I know that," my manager says.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:56.930
<b>Manager</b>

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:56.930
<b>I know that</b>

00:21:56.750 --> 00:22:03.130
I'm human, so it's hard for me to 
speak properly right after I wake up.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:08.520
They say it takes about six hours 
for the human voice to wake up.

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:14.240
But if you have a morning recording, 
that means you don't get to sleep.

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:16.380
It ends badly.

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:20.020
So I wish I could just press a button and 
get a nice high-pitched voice to come out.

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:23.150
Press a button and get a nice 
deep voice to come out.

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:24.960
Let me bark like a dog on command.

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:29.580
I'd love to get modified to do that.

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:34.230
If anyone can make that 
happen, please contact me.

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:37.250
<b>Please do not contact him.</b>

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:37.770
Can we do that? Of course we can.

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:40.720
So what kind of button would it be?

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:44.300
I think you'd want the button to be casual.

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:49.220
Do you mind if I press the 
button and see what happens?

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:50.390
Oh, I see.

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:53.720
Yeah, see... Just a minute.

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.720
Try to press it.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:56.940
Here I go.

00:22:58.060 --> 00:22:59.230
Hello!

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:04.570
See, what kind of bad 
quality voice actor am I?

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:09.900
Could you stop messing with 
my body, please? Honestly...

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:09.900
<b>Thank you for your cooperation.</b>

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:13.820
<i>The landlord invites us into the mountains.</i>

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:18.330
<i>I'm worried about how long Aisuri-neesan 
and Ashisu-neesan's medicine will last,</i>

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.790
<i>but they can always hide in 
the mountains if they need to!</i>

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:25.450
<i>In the mountains, we run into Sumire-chan!</i>

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:28.510
<i>I have so much fun with her!</i>

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:31.370
<i>Wait! Aisuri-neesan!</i>

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:35.670
<i>Next time on </i>Frankenstein 
Family<i>: "Monster."</i>

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>#6:  Monster</b>

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:37.100
<i>Catch it, okay?</i>
